Caroline, what are you saying?

342
00:14:24,620 --> 00:14:26,480
难道一直以来你都在误导我吗
You were just leading me on this whole time?

343
00:14:27,379 --> 00:14:29,507
别这么说 法国臭鼬
Hold it, Pepe Le Pew.

344
00:14:30,120 --> 00:14:32,260
没错 我一直等考完试才敢这么叫你
And, yes, I've been saving that one for after finals.

345
00:14:33,240 --> 00:14:34,580
不能全赖卡洛琳
It is not just Caroline.

346
00:14:34,820 --> 00:14:36,680
你追她比滚动甜甜圈大赛中
You're been chasing after her harder than a fat kid

347
00:14:36,680 --> 00:14:37,920
追着甜甜圈的小胖仔还紧
in a Rolling Doughnut contest.

348
00:14:39,100 --> 00:14:41,000
-没错 -等等 卡洛琳
- That's true. - Wait, wait, Caroline.

349
00:14:41,200 --> 00:14:42,440
我和你到底还有没有可能
Do we still have a shot or not?

350
00:14:42,640 --> 00:14:43,000
没可能
No.

351
00:14:43,440 --> 00:14:44,580
那你最好赶紧躲进浴室
Then better go hide in the bathroom.

352
00:14:44,640 --> 00:14:46,040
我可不想为此而婚姻破裂
I don't want this screwing up my marriage.

353
00:14:47,760 --> 00:14:48,160
什么
What?

354
00:14:49,360 --> 00:14:50,760
如果你不打算跟我在一起
Well, if you're not going to be with me,

355
00:14:50,760 --> 00:14:52,280
那我干嘛要离开我老婆
I'm going to have to stay with my wife.

356
00:14:52,740 --> 00:14:54,900
我可是个血气方刚的男人 离不开女人
I mean, I'm a man. I cannot be alone.

357
00:14:55,180 --> 00:14:55,980
赶紧躲起来
Now, go, go, go.

358
00:14:55,980 --> 00:14:57,500
不能被她发现你在我公寓里
She cannot find you here in our apartment.

359
00:14:57,980 --> 00:14:59,580
你干嘛不直接告诉她
Why don't you just tell her the truth,

360
00:14:59,580 --> 00:15:00,980
咱俩之间是清白的
that nothing happened between us?

361
00:15:01,000 --> 00:15:02,040
她不会相信的
She will not believe me.

362
00:15:02,380 --> 00:15:03,080
因为我有前科
I have a history.

363
00:15:03,520 --> 00:15:04,900
可这里有两个人呢
There are two of us here.

364
00:15:05,260 --> 00:15:06,620
我也有那种前科
I also have that history.

365
00:15:09,105 --> 00:15:11,080
尼可拉斯 是我
Nicolas, c'est moi.

366
00:15:11,080 --> 00:15:12,140
拜托你赶紧走
Now go, please.

367
00:15:12,200 --> 00:15:13,960
你都要毁掉我人生了 赶紧行行好吧
That's the least you can do after ruining my life.

368
00:15:14,480 --> 00:15:16,460
是差一点 差一点就毁掉你的人生
Almost. Almost ruined your life.

369
00:15:16,540 --> 00:15:17,180
快走 麦克斯
Come on, Max.

370
00:15:17,620 --> 00:15:19,840
这场面真是太让我为难了
This is totally inconvenient.

371
00:15:20,260 --> 00:15:22,260
你最好把我的分数从C提到B
My "C" better go up to a "B."

372
00:15:27,280 --> 00:15:30,260
太没下限了 我们居然像两个廉价妓女
This is crazy, us hiding in a married man's bathroom

373
00:15:30,260 --> 00:15:31,880
躲在已婚男人的浴室里
like a couple of cheap floozies.

374
00:15:32,420 --> 00:15:34,680
到目前为止 我听见的只是
So far, I'm just hearing a factual depiction

375
00:15:34,680 --> 00:15:35,700
你对事实的陈述
of what's happening here.

376
00:15:36,680 --> 00:15:38,620
我去看看什么情况
Let me see what's going on.

377
00:15:45,380 --> 00:15:47,320
完全听不懂
I can't understand them.

378
00:15:47,600 --> 00:15:48,860
我以为你懂法语呢
I thought you spoke French.

379
00:15:49,080 --> 00:15:50,932
只能在美国人面前显摆
Only enough to impress Americans.

380
00:15:50,932 --> 00:15:54,340
我要去厕所[法语]
Je dois utiliser les toilettes.

381
00:15:54,340 --> 00:15:55,740
天啊 厕所
Oh, my god. Les toilettes.

382
00:15:56,000 --> 00:15:57,560
她说的就是这里
Les toilettes, that's where we are.

383
00:15:57,820 --> 00:16:00,560
她要进来了 我们该怎么办
She's coming in here! What should we do?

384
00:16:00,720 --> 00:16:01,920
假装我们是性感的水管工吗
Pretend we're hot plumbers?

385
00:16:02,680 --> 00:16:03,520
快躲进淋浴间里
Hide in the shower.

386
00:16:10,540 --> 00:16:12,640
我觉得她会看见我们呢
I think she might notice us.

387
00:16:15,914 --> 00:16:18,073
你们知道这全是玻璃吧
You know that's all glass, right?

388
00:16:18,620 --> 00:16:20,380
我给你拿个干净的擦手毛巾
Let me just get you a clean hand towel.

389
00:16:21,280 --> 00:16:22,320
她要尿尿
She has to pee-pee.

390
00:16:22,900 --> 00:16:24,540
她不能进来用马桶
She can't come in here to use the toilet,

391
00:16:24,720 --> 00:16:25,820
因为我屎一般的人生先占了
'cause my life is in it.

392
00:16:26,994 --> 00:16:28,440
我知道 这真是太不幸了
I know, this is unfortunate.

393
00:16:28,440 --> 00:16:29,400
那你们从窗户走吧
So go out the window.

394
00:16:30,180 --> 00:16:30,660
你说什么
What?

395
00:16:31,400 --> 00:16:33,200
没问题的
It's not a problem.

396
00:16:33,480 --> 00:16:35,340
外面有个足够宽的窗沿 你们可以从那
There's a ledge wide enough for you to walk

397
00:16:35,340 --> 00:16:37,660
走到邻居家的阳台 然后跳过去逃走
to the neighbor's terrace, jump, and get away.

398
00:16:38,260 --> 00:16:39,060
斯蒂芬妮就这么做
Stephanie did it.

399
00:16:39,860 --> 00:16:40,800
斯蒂芬妮是谁
Who's Stephanie?

400
00:16:41,420 --> 00:16:42,820
那不重要
That's...not important.

401
00:16:43,360 --> 00:16:44,100
重要的是她人没事
She's fine.

402
00:16:45,560 --> 00:16:47,700
快走 你们必须得离开
Now go. You have to go.

403
00:16:48,315 --> 00:16:50,620
除非你觉得我们之间还有可能
Unless you think you and I still have a shot.

404
00:16:50,620 --> 00:16:52,000
我现在就上窗沿
I'll be on the ledge.

405
00:16:55,400 --> 00:16:56,520
快点 麦克斯
Come on, Max.

406
00:16:57,020 --> 00:16:59,040
不要 不可能 露西
No way, not happening, Lucy.

407
00:16:59,640 --> 00:17:02,200
如果他失去这段烂婚姻
If he loses his bad marriage,

408
00:17:02,260 --> 00:17:03,380
那我就是凶手
I'm responsible.

409
00:17:03,380 --> 00:17:05,780
差一点 差一点就是凶手
Almost. Almost responsible.

410
00:17:06,340 --> 00:17:08,000
麦克斯 如果不是为了把你弄进烘培学校
Max, I wouldn't even be in this situation

411
00:17:08,000 --> 00:17:09,240
我就不用跟他一起工作
if I wasn't working with him to

412
00:17:09,240 --> 00:17:10,740
更不会沦落在今天这个田地
put you through pastry school.

413
00:17:10,820 --> 00:17:12,100
所以怪我咯
Oh, so this is my fault?

414
00:17:12,540 --> 00:17:14,280
麦克斯 你就当是你的错吧
Max, please just let it be your fault.

415
00:17:20,720 --> 00:17:22,080
完全是可行的
It's completely doable.

416
00:17:22,580 --> 00:17:23,880
对了 外面在下雨呢
By the way, it's raining.

417
00:17:25,240 --> 00:17:26,920
走吧 我们可以的
Come on. We can do this.

418
00:17:27,200 --> 00:17:28,460
我们在家楼顶爬上15英尺高
We've crawled 15 feet on our roof

419
00:17:28,460 --> 00:17:29,580
就为了偷电视信号
to get illegal cable.

420
00:17:29,920 --> 00:17:32,420
那是为了看《绝命毒师》的最终集
Yeah, for the Breaking Bad finale!

421
00:17:32,920 --> 00:17:35,640
就算摔死也在所不惜
Something worth dying for!

422
00:17:39,500 --> 00:17:41,240
天啊 你疯了吗
Oh, my God, are you insane?

423
00:17:41,360 --> 00:17:42,540
快进来
Get back in here!

424
00:17:43,220 --> 00:17:44,280
麦克斯 或许你是对的
Max, maybe you're right.

425
00:17:44,280 --> 00:17:46,380
我们应该用性感水管工的那招
We should've taken the hot plumber route.

426
00:17:47,720 --> 00:17:48,780
我现在就回去
I'm coming back.

427
00:17:50,160 --> 00:17:51,278
我的腿吓得走不动了
My legs won't go!

428
00:17:51,278 --> 00:17:53,380
麦克斯 拉我回去
Max, help me back!

429
00:17:53,380 --> 00:17:55,040
妈的 我恨死你了 贱人
Damn it. Damn it, bitch.

430
00:18:00,660 --> 00:18:01,800
她进厕所了
She's in the bathroom.

431
00:18:04,720 --> 00:18:06,060
她把窗户关上了
Oh, she closed the window.

432
00:18:06,520 --> 00:18:08,660
而且还锁上了 现在没回头路了
and she locked it. So go.

433
00:18:08,860 --> 00:18:09,771
往前走吧
Go, go!

434
00:18:09,771 --> 00:18:13,480
如果斯蒂芬妮能做到 我们也能
If Stephanie did it, we can too.

435
00:18:13,480 --> 00:18:15,740
真不敢相信因为他 我们得"铤而走险"
I can't believe we're up here all because of him.

436
00:18:15,800 --> 00:18:18,080
我看人真是没眼光
I am such a bad judge of character.

437
00:18:18,600 --> 00:18:20,480
废话 看你选我当你最好的朋友就知道
Of course you are. I'm your best friend.

438
00:18:21,540 --> 00:18:23,580
麦克斯 对不起 这真是太惨了
Max, I'm sorry. This is bad.

439
00:18:23,580 --> 00:18:26,820
至少不会更惨了 除非我们摔下去
Well, at least it can't get any worse, unless we fall.

440
00:18:27,940 --> 00:18:29,500
或者开始下冰雹
Oh! Or it starts to hail!

441
00:18:29,573 --> 00:18:32,420
哎哟 砸"雹"老娘了
Ow! Ow! Hurts like "hail!"

442
00:18:32,420 --> 00:18:33,780
他们走了 快走
It's clear! Come on!

443
00:18:34,360 --> 00:18:36,940
-我不想死 -我也是
- I don't wanna die! - Me neither!

444
00:18:38,160 --> 00:18:39,040
真是奇了怪了
That's weird.

445
00:18:39,400 --> 00:18:41,620
我人生中第一次不想死
For the first time in my life, I don't want to die.

446
00:18:41,960 --> 00:18:43,760
我有了男朋友和我人生第一个"B"
I have a boyfriend and my first "B."

447
00:18:43,980 --> 00:18:45,320
妈的 老娘内心变柔软了
Oh, God, I'm getting soft!

448
00:18:45,480 --> 00:18:48,100
我不能死 我还没东山再起呢
I can't die! I haven't made my comeback yet.

449
00:18:48,180 --> 00:18:50,342
我还幻想着 咱俩会搬进我从詹妮弗·劳伦斯
In my fantasy, you and I move into that penthouse

450
00:18:50,342 --> 00:18:51,800
那里买来的的顶层公寓
I bought from Jennifer Lawrence.

451
00:18:51,800 --> 00:18:54,840
还有屋顶花园哦 就在那边 看见了吗
Right over there, with the roof garden, see?

452
00:18:59,780 --> 00:19:01,640
你们俩没事吧
Are you two all right?

453
00:19:02,240 --> 00:19:04,380
虽然我不认识你俩
I mean, whoever you are.

454
00:19:06,460 --> 00:19:07,520
我死了吗
Am I dead?

455
00:19:08,540 --> 00:19:10,860
差一点 差一点就死了
Almost. Almost dead.

456
00:19:16,880 --> 00:19:19,220
我的老天爷
Oh, my God.

457
00:19:19,340 --> 00:19:20,800
你们俩怎么搞的
What happened to you two?

458
00:19:20,800 --> 00:19:22,840
我们撞破了一扇窗
Well, we crashed through a window.

459
00:19:23,020 --> 00:19:23,800
超屌的
It was pretty dope.

460
00:19:24,960 --> 00:19:26,400
有点像电影《虎胆龙威》
It was kinda like a Die Hard movie,

461
00:19:26,400 --> 00:19:28,420
如果他们在电影里也让女人耍酷的话
if they ever let girls do cool stuff in those movies.

462
00:19:29,736 --> 00:19:31,180
脖子还好吗
The necks all right?

463
00:19:31,180 --> 00:19:33,600
我们颈部扭伤了 我背部也受伤了
We have whiplash, and I have some bruises on my back.

464
00:19:33,860 --> 00:19:35,660
麦克斯摔得最重 不过她不觉得疼
Max took the brunt of the fall but feels nothing

465
00:19:35,660 --> 00:19:36,800
因为她体内主要成分是维柯丁
because she's mostly made of vicodin.

466
00:19:38,500 --> 00:19:40,240
很高兴你没事
Well, I'm glad you survived,

467
00:19:40,240 --> 00:19:41,900
因为如果你不在我身边
because I don't know what I would do

468
00:19:41,900 --> 00:19:43,300
我不知道该如何是好
without you around here.

469
00:19:43,520 --> 00:19:44,740
这话真窝心 厄尔
Aw, thanks, Earl.

470
00:19:45,840 --> 00:19:47,000
其实我指的是你
I meant you.

471
00:19:49,520 --> 00:19:50,280
我知道
I know.

472
00:19:52,140 --> 00:19:53,940
麦克斯 你怎么会这么有劲
Max, how were you ever strong enough

473
00:19:53,940 --> 00:19:55,320
用一只手就把我拉回来
to hold me up with one arm?

474
00:19:55,500 --> 00:19:56,820
我小时候就经常用那只手
It's the arm I used to drag my mother

475
00:19:56,820 --> 00:19:58,020
把我妈从酒吧里拽出来
out of bars with as a baby.

476
00:20:00,080 --> 00:20:02,040
我有话要对你说
Well, I want to say something to you.

477
00:20:02,720 --> 00:20:05,120
我想让你知道 如果在窗沿
I hope you know that if you were the one

478
00:20:05,120 --> 00:20:06,720
滑倒的那个人是你
that slipped on that ledge--

479
00:20:06,720 --> 00:20:07,520
我肯定就死了吧
I would be dead.

480
00:20:10,160 --> 00:20:11,620
很高兴你能明白这个道理
Well, I'm glad that's out in the open.

481
00:20:12,762 --> 00:20:14,460
各位安安
Hey, everybody!

482
00:20:14,460 --> 00:20:16,600
我有近况要通报
I have an update about my life!

483
00:20:20,180 --> 00:20:21,660
你们俩怎么搞的
What happened to you two?

484
00:20:22,000 --> 00:20:24,560
苏菲 我们发生了意外 说来话长啊
Sophie, we had an accident. It's a long story.

485
00:20:24,860 --> 00:20:26,660
你的故事都很长
Yeah, all of yours are.

486
00:20:28,920 --> 00:20:31,560
我要退出电影圈
Well, I'm out of the movie business.

487
00:20:32,020 --> 00:20:34,660
我跟电影公司的的那位大假发分手了
I broke up with my bigwig from Miramax.

488
00:20:35,100 --> 00:20:36,660
我们大吵了一架
We got in a huge fight,

489
00:20:36,660 --> 00:20:38,900
他还拿他的大假发扔我
And he threw his big wig at me.

490
00:20:40,160 --> 00:20:43,860
他警告我永远别想在这城市里吃上午饭
He told me I'd never eat lunch in this town again.

491
00:20:44,020 --> 00:20:45,400
而我说
And I said,

492
00:20:46,080 --> 00:20:47,860
"如果我在市里
"Hey, if I'm in town,

493
00:20:47,980 --> 00:20:49,460
姐饿了就会去午饭 宝贝"
I'm eating lunch, baby!"

494
00:20:52,920 --> 00:20:55,060
不是吧 甭装了
Oh, no. No, no, no,

495
00:20:55,060 --> 00:20:57,460
我全身到处被蜘蛛咬得遍体鳞伤
I don't have spider bites over half my body

496
00:20:57,460 --> 00:20:59,400
不是为了让你们俩能继续装病的
so you two could fake another injury.

497
00:20:59,680 --> 00:21:00,700
想得美
Nice try.

498
00:21:03,189 --> 00:21:05,409
一定很疼吧
Ooh, I'll bet that hurts.
